# 📝 To-Do App

A simple and responsive **To-Do List Application** built with **HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, and JavaScript**.  
This app helps you stay organized by allowing you to add, complete, delete, and save tasks in your browser.  

---

## 🚀 Features
- ➕ **Add Task** – Add a task with the input field & "Add" button (or press **Enter**)  
- ✅ **Mark Complete** – Click a task to toggle complete/incomplete (strikethrough for completed tasks)  
- ❌ **Delete Task** – Remove tasks easily with a delete button  
- 💾 **Persistent Storage** – Tasks are saved in **localStorage** and remain after refreshing  
- 📋 **Empty State Message** – Friendly message when the task list is empty  
- 🎨 **Responsive Design** – Styled with **Bootstrap** for all screen sizes  

